name: ['Aggravated Assault', 'Armageddon', 'Attrition', 'Austere Command', 'Avatar of Woe', 'Aven Mindcensor', 'Blood Moon', 'Boil', 'Bontu the Glorified', 'Capsize', 'Chain Lightning', 'Choke', 'Consecrated Sphinx', 'Containment Priest', 'Counterbalance', 'Counterspell', 'Cryptic Command', 'Damnation', 'Dark Ritual', 'Daze', 'Desolation Angel', 'Diabolic Edict', 'Diabolic Intent', 'Divert', 'Doomsday', 'Entomb', 'Forbid', 'Force of Will', 'Hazoret the Fervent', 'Kefnet the Mindful', 'Lord of Extinction', 'Loyal Retainers', 'Maelstrom Pulse', 'Mind Twist', 'No Mercy', 'Oketra the True', 'Omniscience', 'Opposition', 'Pact of Negation', 'Rhonas the Indomitable', 'Shatterstorm', 'Slaughter Pact', 'Spell Pierce', 'Stifle', 'Sunder', 'The Locust God', 'The Scarab God', 'The Scorpion God', 'Thoughtseize', 'Threads of Disloyalty', 'Through the Breach', 'Vindicate', 'Worship', 'Wrath of God']
