artist: ['Bastien L. Deharme', 'Chase Stone', 'Christine Choi', 'Cliff Childs', 'Daarken', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'Eytan Zana', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Ryman', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Johann Bodin', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jose Cabrera', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Philip Straub', 'Richard Wright', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Titus Lunter', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zack Stella']
